of the \code{Hints} object: \verb{\{id\}_cicerone_hint_opened},
\verb{\{id\}_cicerone_hint_dismissed}, and \verb{\{id\}_cicerone_hint_button}.
Each carries a list with the hint's \code{id} and \code{element}.
